        <p>WILL BE PUBLISHED ON FRIDAY NEXT WEEK,</p>
        <p>OWING TO NEW YEAR'S DAY ()COMING</p>
        <p>ON SATURDAY.</p>
        <p>AT CHF ORD BAPTIST CHURCH, I TO-MORROW (SUNDAY), DECEMBER 26TH. 3lort..Nrso, 10.30. EVENING, 0. PREACHER: MR. E. WYNNE JONES, Warrington. OFFERTORIES.</p>
        <p>WYCLIFFE CONGREGATIONAL CHURCH BEWSEY STREET. TO-MORROW (SUNDAY). DECEMBER 26th PREACHY:Ft •. REV. J. YONGE. 10.30 AND 6.30. P.S.A. FOR MEN AT 3 P.M. Watch Night Service, Friday, Dec. 31st, at 11-15 conducted by Rev. H. WALL.</p>
        <p>BOLD STREET ESLEIAS CHURCH W ARRINGTON TO-MORROW (SUNDAY), DECEMBER 26Trr. Morning 10.30. REV. E. BLANSHARD KEELING. Evening 6.30. REV. THOMAS MILLER. All welcome. Hymn Books provided.</p>
        <p>BAPTIST CHURCH, GOLBORNE STREET TO-MORROW (SUNDAY), DECEMBER 26TH. PREACHER: REV. R. E. LETHEREN. Morning 10.45. Evening 6.30. BROTHERHOOD MEETING 3.0. IVATCHNIGHT SERVICE, Friday 31st, at 11 p.m.</p>
        <p>ROAD WESLEYAN CHURCH WARRINGTON. TO-MORROW (SUNDAY), DECEMBER 26TH. Morning 10.30. REV. THOMAS MILLER. Evening 6.30. REV. E. BLANSHARD KEELING. All welcome. Hymn Books provided. Watch Night Service Dec. 31st. at 11 o'clock, tev. E. Blanshard Keeling.</p>
