        <p>MATINEE ON MONDAY, DECEMBER 27TH AT 1.30. Grand Special Production of T. EDWARD WARD'S NEW PLAY including the Brilliant Young Actress— MISS WARD, in a New Emotional. Play, entitled "HIS REAL .WIFE." Doors open at 7.0. Curtain rises at 7.30 (Saturdays at 7.15). Early doors 6.45. Next Week "TWO LITTLE VAGABCINDS." Look out for" ROBINSON CRUSOE."</p>
