        <p>G. T. P. G. T. P. Hunslet 2 2 10 Hull Kingst'nß. 0 2 6 Hslifax 4 3 17 Leeds 0 1 3 Hull - - - 4 832 Bramley ___ 0 0 0</p>
        <p>_ - Huddersfield Wakefield Trin. ... 5 937 Keigbley Warrington 3 830 Barrow 2 1 6 Oldham 6 8 36 St. Helens Ebbw Vale - 1 3 Widnes 0 0 0 Rochdale Hornets 1 3 It Batley Wigan - 0 0 0 Swinton Salford 4 4 20 Runcorn Bradford Northern 1 2 8 York 1 1 5</p>
