      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1909-12-24_WidnesExaminer_art0071" n="art0071">
        <head>"TITE 'III' I TIME PAYS Fl 1 ALL!"</head>
        <p>"TITE 'III' I TIME PAYS Fl 1 ALL!"</p>
        <p>Mr. Crosfield &amp;lain carries the Fla: of Liberty &amp; Liberalism.</p>
